# Per-agent/per-developer Playwright configs pointing at a pinned local port.
# Several worktrees run concurrently and Vite defaults to 5173 in all of them;
# the shared config must never be edited for one run, so local overrides are
# expected -- and must not be committed. See the port section in the
# contributor brief.
*.local.config.ts
